## Return contract

Every bout ends with: the result; the evidence paths (result manifest and
outputs); the actual tools and surfaces used; deviations and fallbacks
with reasons; limitations; and unresolved decisions. When a branch's
execution could affect a subsequent implementation or scientific
decision, emit branch-consumption entries (template in the collaboration
guide). <!-- v7: RB-4, RB-6 -->
